    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"One to seventeen years · From £280\",\"title\":\"Circumcision for children and teenagers\",\"lede\":\"Circumcision can make both a child and his parents anxious. When you book, we will send you simple and short videos to watch so that you know what to expect and how to prepare your son for circumcision in a way that is appropriate for the child's age.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Who we see\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\"},{\"label\":\"Children and teenagers\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Parents can ask questions anytime before the appointment if they have anything they are unsure about.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Local anaesthetic is given and the area is checked before the procedure. For older children and teenagers we commonly use the forceps-guided (traditional) method with thermal cautery to minimize bleeding. The foreskin is drawn forward and a specialist forceps guides the removal. Depending on the wound, closure may involve skin glue, dissolvable stitches, a combination of both, or occasionally neither.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Afterwards, the patient can put on his own underwear, trousers and walk normally. We provide written aftercare instructions and explain how to care for the area at home. See the <a href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\">aftercare page</a>.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/spec-panel {\"eyebrow\":\"At a glance\",\"rows\":[{\"k\":\"Age\",\"v\":\"Children and teenagers\"},{\"k\":\"Common method\",\"v\":\"Forceps-guided (traditional) with thermal cautery\"},{\"k\":\"Anaesthetic\",\"v\":\"Local anaesthetic\"},{\"k\":\"Closure\",\"v\":\"Skin glue, dissolvable stitches, both, or occasionally neither\"},{\"k\":\"School letters\",\"v\":\"Ask the clinic if needed\"},{\"k\":\"Price\",\"v\":\"From £280, depending on age\"}],\"note\":\"From £280, depending on age. See the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/u0022 style=u0022color:var(u002du002dblue-deep)u0022u003efull price listu003c/au003e, broken down by age band.\"} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Before you come\",\"heading\":\"Preparing your child\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022 style=u0022max-width:74chu0022u003ern        u003culu003ern          u003cliu003eKeep the explanation simple and age appropriate. Too much detail can increase anxiety. Our practitioners are accustomed to talking directly to children and teenagers and explaining the process calmly on the day.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eTell us about any medical problems before the appointment.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eBring the identification and consent documents requested by the clinic.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eBring something familiar to keep your child occupied such as a tablet or video game.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eIf you need a school letter, ask the clinic.u003c/liu003ern          u003cliu003eSchool-holiday appointments can be busy, so book early if timing is important.u003c/liu003ern        u003c/ulu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":false,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Medical need\",\"heading\":\"Medical or foreskin problems\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003ern        u003cpu003eIf your son has u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/u0022u003ephimosisu003c/au003e, recurrent inflammation, a u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/buried-penis/u0022u003eburied penisu003c/au003e or another foreskin problem, tell us when you contact the clinic. These cases may need a more detailed examination and an individual quotation.u003c/pu003ern      u003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":false} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/figure {\"name\":\"waiting-room\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask us first\",\"formId\":\"children\",\"subject\":\"children and teenagers enquiry\",\"urgent\":true} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Also at this clinic\",\"heading\":\"Circumcision at other ages\",\"lede\":\"\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/group-cards {\"level\":3,\"exclude\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/children/\",\"banded\":false} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->"
